"Burns essence blood in exchange for a short burst of power. Combat power "
"increases within 3 years, but meridians are damaged and combat power "
"decreases within 10 years."

#. elixir.csv: Qi Refinement Blood Burning Pill
msgid "ELIXIR_3009_NAME"
msgstr "Qi Refinement Blood Burning Pill"

#. elixir.csv: A potent medicine to stimulate potential. Comba...
