"The choice for Core Formation cultivators when fighting for their lives. "
"Combat power surges within 3 years, but severe injury within 10 years."

#. elixir.csv: Core Formation Blood Burning Pill
msgid "ELIXIR_3011_NAME"
msgstr "Core Formation Blood Burning Pill"

#. elixir.csv: Burns the Nascent Soul origin. Gains world-dest...
msgid "ELIXIR_3012_DESC"
msgstr ""
"Burns the Nascent Soul origin. Gains world-destroying power within 3 years, "
"but becomes almost a cripple within 10 years."

#. elixir.csv: Nascent Soul Blood Burning Pill
msgid "ELIXIR_3012_NAME"
msgstr "Nascent Soul Blood Burning Pill"

#. elixir.csv: A common healing pill that can restore the inju...
msgid "ELIXIR_3013_DESC"
msgstr ""
"A common healing pill that can restore the injuries of Qi Refinement stage "
"cultivators (lasts 5 years)."

#. elixir.csv: Qi Refinement Rejuvenation Pill
msgid "ELIXIR_3013_NAME"
msgstr "Qi Refinement Rejuvenation Pill"

#. elixir.csv: The medicinal power is gentle and mellow
